@startuml
skinparam maxMessageSize 150
skinparam ParticipantPadding 20

title Authentication & Device Control Sequence

actor Terminal_Admin
actor Keypad_User
participant "Comm_Handler" as Comm
participant "Main_App" as Main
participant "Login_Manager" as Login
participant "EEPROM_MCAL" as EEPROM
participant "Device_Control" as Devices
participant "WDT_MCAL" as WDT

== Terminal Admin Login ==
Terminal_Admin -> Comm: Input ID
Terminal_Admin -> Comm: Input Password (4 digits)
Comm -> Login: Login_u8Authenticate(TERMINAL, ID, Pass)
Login -> EEPROM: Read Admin Address (0x00)
EEPROM --> Login: Admin stored ID & Pass
Login -> Login: Compare hashes/credentials
Login --> Comm: LOGIN_ADMIN_ROLE (Success)

== Terminal Admin Configures Keypad ==
Terminal_Admin -> Comm: "permit user"
Comm -> Comm: g_u8KpdUserPermitted = 1

== Keypad User Login ==
Keypad_User -> Main: Enter ID & Pass (LCD/KPD loop)
Main -> Login: Login_u8Authenticate(KPD, ID, Pass)
Login -> EEPROM: Read User Slots Address (0x10...)
EEPROM --> Login: User stored ID & Pass
Login --> Main: LOGIN_USER_ROLE (Success)
Main -> Comm: Comm_voidSetKpdStatus(1)

== Keypad Device Interaction ==
Keypad_User -> Main: Enable L1 (Key '2' pressed on L1 option)
Main -> Comm: Comm_u8IsKpdUserPermitted()
Comm --> Main: Return 1 (Permitted)
Main -> Devices: Device_voidSetLamp(LAMP1, LAMP_ON)

== Alarm Trigger on Failed Logins ==
Keypad_User -> Main: Invalid ID/Pass
Main -> Login: Login_u8Authenticate(KPD, ID, Pass)
Login --> Main: LOGIN_NO_ROLE
Main -> Login: Increment fail attempts
Main -> Login: GetFailedAttempts() == 3 
Login -> WDT: WDT_voidEnable(WDT_TIMEOUT_2S)
Main -> Keypad_User: LCD "ALARM TRIGGERED!"
WDT -> Main: RESET MCU

@enduml
